? The benefits management plan names a benefit owner, usually in the business, who tracks benefits after the project closes.

@@ PR3 | Hybrid
A new pricing engine is ready for one product category, while other categories need several more months. How can the project deliver value sooner?
A) Release the engine for the ready category to a pilot group and gather feedback
B) Wait until all categories are ready so that customers see a consistent product
C) Release the engine to all customers immediately with incomplete categories
D) Postpone the pilot until the sponsor approves the complete solution design
= A
