C) Leave the allocation unchanged, since it is decided by the resource manager
D) Ask each team to reduce its expectations of the developer's contribution
= A
? Context switching wastes capacity. Presenting the impact and negotiating dedication improves flow for the teams and the developer.

@@ PR4 | Hybrid
