A) Cost plus award fee
B) Firm fixed price
C) Fixed price incentive fee
D) Time and materials with a cap
= A
? CPAF reimburses costs and adds an award fee based on the buyer's subjective evaluation of performance, suitable for uncertain scope.

@@ PR5 | Agile
