@@ PR5 | Hybrid
Four proposals are scored on technical quality (weight 60%) and price (weight 40%). Vendor A: technical 80, price 70. Vendor B: technical 70, price 90. Vendor C: technical 90, price 50. Vendor D: technical 75, price 75. Which vendor has the highest weighted score?
A) Vendor B
B) Vendor A
C) Vendor C
D) Vendor D
= A
? Weighted scores: A = 48 + 28 = 76; B = 42 + 36 = 78; C = 54 + 20 = 74; D = 45 + 30 = 75. Vendor B scores highest.

