@@ PR8 | Predictive
An activity has an optimistic estimate of 4 days, a most likely estimate of 7 days and a pessimistic estimate of 16 days. What are its PERT estimate and standard deviation?
A) 8 days and 2 days
B) 9 days and 2 days
C) 7 days and 3 days
D) 8 days and 4 days
= A
? PERT = (4 + 4 × 7 + 16) / 6 = 48 / 6 = 8 days; σ = (16 − 4) / 6 = 2 days.

@@ PR8 | Predictive
