A) It moves out by 2 days
B) It moves out by 4 days
C) It does not change
D) It moves out by 6 days
= A
? Float absorbs the first 2 days of the delay; the remaining 2 days push the project end date out.

@@ PR8 | Agile
The team wants to move from two-week to four-week sprints because large stories rarely finish within two weeks. What should the scrum master advise?
A) Keep the short cadence and work with the product owner to split stories smaller
