@@ PR8 | Predictive
Two critical-path activities can be crashed. Activity P: normal 10 days for $20,000; crash 7 days for $29,000. Activity Q: normal 8 days for $15,000; crash 6 days for $19,000. Which activity should be crashed first?
A) Activity Q, at $2,000 per day saved
